    "hand_kw": "Moon = Yin: Container, medium, environment, matrix, womb, mothering, home; subjects as opposed to rulers; one's Ultimate Source; the Great Mother; personal past, childhood, heritage, family, heredity, homeland; unconscious assumptions/attitudes, instincts, hereditary mental patterns, emotional reflexes/programs, psychic perceptions.  |  Sagittarius = understanding one's social context, expressing will through abstract principles; idealistic and freedom-loving, or socially integrated as spokesman; prefers wisdom to knowledge; an influence for increased freedom.",
