    "hand_kw": "Mercury = The Logos, articulation of truth; the mind, communication, logic and reasoning, the nervous system; physical dexterity, movement, transportation, routine travel; connecting, symbol-making, creation of images/cognitive maps/correspondences, translation; restlessness (hunger for input).  |  Aries = beginnings; primitive/raw undirected energy; willful but unstable; can be asocial; pioneering, not concerned with practicality; enthusiasm, short-lived anger; impatient; a vitalizing influence.",
