    "hand_kw": "Venus = (Yin.) Love, nonverbal expression of truth; intrinsic bonding from within, non-coercive grouping, spontaneous attractions; creation of harmony of higher wholes out of complementary elements, of beauty; social adeptness; unconditional mother-love (with the Moon); sexuality (complementarily with Mars).  |  Aries = beginnings; primitive/raw undirected energy; willful but unstable; can be asocial; pioneering, not concerned with practicality; enthusiasm, short-lived anger; impatient; a vitalizing influence.",
