    "hand_kw": "Pluto = Archetype of death and resurrection; complete breakdown of Saturnine reality, forcing one to build a new 'normal' reality; radical transformations of consciousness and being; transcendental aspects of sexuality; political power as a manifestation of historical processes; agents of breakdown/decay; healers, therapists, teachers of self-transformation, gurus.  |  Aries = beginnings; primitive/raw undirected energy; willful but unstable; can be asocial; pioneering, not concerned with practicality; enthusiasm, short-lived anger; impatient; a vitalizing influence.",
